	('67f6d9860b7fd3757b014d4a', 'Cannellini Bean Curry', '**Type:** One-pot\n**Vibe:** Mild & creamy\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- 1 can cannellini beans\n- 1/2 cup coconut milk\n- 1/2 cup tomato sauce\n- 1/2 tsp cumin\n- 1/2 tsp turmeric\n- Garlic/onion powder\n- Optional: serve over rice\n\n**How-to:**\nSimmer all ingredients together for 15–20 min. Serve over rice or scoop with flatbread if you’ve got it.', '2025-04-09 15:33:21', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
	('67f6d9aa58884dc595fe1691', 'White Bean & Chicken Shepherd’s Pie', '**Type:** Casserole\n**Vibe:** Hearty & homey\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- 1 can cannellini beans\n- 1–2 chicken breasts (cooked & chopped or shredded)\n- 1/2 cup broth\n- Garlic/onion powder, Italian herbs\n- Mashed potatoes (can be made with butter + coconut milk)\n\n**How-to:**\nMix beans, chicken, broth, and seasoning in a casserole dish. Top with mashed potatoes. Bake at 375°F for 20 min.', '2025-04-27 21:29:03', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
	('67f6db51765d2af8a6120b7d', 'Creamy Navy Bean & Rice Skillet', '**Type:** One-pot\n**Vibe:** Rich, soft, almost risotto-like\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- 1 can navy beans\n- 1 cup white rice\n- 1/2 cup coconut milk\n- 2 cups broth or water\n- Garlic/onion powder, Italian seasoning, salt\n\n**How-to:**\nSauté seasonings in olive oil, add rice and liquid, bring to boil. Add beans halfway through. Simmer covered 18–20 min. Stir at the end—it’ll get creamy!', '2025-04-09 15:41:00', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
	('67f6db7c34cc1b5aba24924f', 'Navy Bean Coconut Soup', '**Type:** Soup\n**Vibe:** Smooth and simple\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- 1 can navy beans\n- 1/2 can coconut milk\n- 1 cup broth\n- Garlic/onion powder\n- Thyme or rosemary\n- Optional: a handful of spinach or kale\n\n**How-to:**\nSimmer all ingredients for 15–20 minutes. Blend half or all for a smooth texture.', '2025-04-09 15:41:37', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
