	('67f6dbb11897fad863756c6b', 'Navy Bean Pasta Bake', '**Type:** Bake\n**Vibe:** Mild and creamy\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- Cooked GF pasta\n- 1 can navy beans\n- 1/2 cup coconut milk\n- Garlic/onion powder, Italian herbs\n- Optional: cheddar cheese topping\n\n**How-to:**\nBlend beans with coconut milk and seasonings. Toss with pasta, put in baking dish, top with cheese. Bake at 375°F for 20 min.', '2025-04-09 15:42:29', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
	('67f6dbca7dc8d6736fe0c669', 'Mild Navy Bean Curry', '**Type:** One-pot\n**Vibe:** Creamy and lightly spiced\n**Ingredients:**\n\n- 1 can navy beans\n- 1/2 cup tomato sauce\n- 1/2 cup coconut milk\n- Garlic/onion powder\n- Cumin, turmeric, chili powder (optional)\n- Serve with rice\n\n**How-to:**\nSimmer everything for 15–20 minutes. Adjust seasoning to taste. Serve hot.', '2025-04-09 15:42:55', '2025-08-11 15:30:16', '2025-08-11 10:30:16'),
